                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": ["space"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "search_board_items",
      "description": "Search project Issues (事项), distinct from personal tasks and conversations, by assignee, creator and structured filters within an explicit project, workspace or accessible scope. Use participation:mine with scope kind accessible for all currently readable Issues whose Issue participant list contains the authenticated user. Identify the project and Issue ID in results; if a queried project has no matching Issues, state that scoped empty result. Read all pages and coverage before claiming complete results; reuse query_id for aggregation.",
